        <mxCell id="Kr28CH0wk7RwmuvBFSXC-16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="They don&#39;t track model version. What happens if a model is retired?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Also, how do we know if a model was trained on the most recent data?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;= there are a lot of unknowns for them, since this is still a relatively new/emerging area&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
