        <mxCell id="Kr28CH0wk7RwmuvBFSXC-24" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="For ex. Robodebt&lt;div&gt;For ex. AI medical scribes writing falsehoods about a patient&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For ex. Deloitte AI citation report scandal&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For ex. fake court cases used by lawyers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For ex. deepfake video scams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For ex. gov bias --&amp;nbsp; a dutch risk algorithm wrongly flagged families with dual nationaly as fradualent.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
